OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order march row goes to
OL,4,Aheart of ongoing divisions in Northern
OL,5,AIreland
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Orange Order is a Protestant
OL,8,Fpro-British organisation. The area
OL,9,Fwhere it wants to walk is largely
OL,10,FCatholic, and predominantly inhabited
OL,11,Fby pro-Irish nationalists.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
